  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Arctic Ocean-Climate Chemistry Data, 1974-1989",
  "description": "Carbon cycle, nutrient and salinity data from several arctic cruises: July and September, 1989 ; 1974 and 1975 to the Beaufort Sea; and in 1977 to the Amundsen Gulf.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Observations of carbon cycling in the arctic.\n\nSupplemental information: Priority: 3 Priority Justification: Null Risk Justification: Custodian will be leaving soon and has a large quantity of data not secured in a regional data centre. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Data are related to a subject, location or species of concern within the scientific, government or public community within the last 5 years. Impact of Loss: Medium Recommended Action: Obtain access to data, assess data and bring to archives if possible. Additional Info: Null",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23570052",
